# The board outside a race, on a level mod's level (src/game/enhance/level_mod_hero.h; docs/open-engine.md, "The board outside a
# race"; nothing on the original's Kalebo III and Rilgar). The board's race code compares the level number: its fall test (z
# under 76 on Kalebo III, 61.4 on Rilgar: the race's fall state 0x6e, then "back on the track") and its race's start line read it,
# and a level mod's number is its base's. In a world of the board's planet (`world rilgar` on Kalebo III's base) the compares see
# that planet (level_mod_board_planet); a free board (the mod's own geometry, another planet's world) has its own fall test
# (level_mod_board_fell), its "back on the track" place is the plugin's or where he got on (level_mod_board_back) and its race
# HUD (the requests 5 and 7 at the mount) is not asked for (level_mod_board_hud_off).
